<!-- MODAL -->
<div id="ndtModal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close" onclick="closeModal('ndtModal')">&times;</span>

        <h2>Non-Destructive Testing (NDT) & Inspection</h2>

        <p>
            We provide reliable NDT and Third-Party Mechanical Inspection services to ensure
            asset integrity, safety, and regulatory compliance without affecting serviceability.
        </p>

        <h3>Our NDT Services Include:</h3>

        <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Ultrasonic Testing (UT)</li>
            <li>Radiographic Testing (RT)</li>
            <li>Magnetic Particle Testing (MPT)</li>
            <li>Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT)</li>
            <li>Visual Testing (VT)</li>
            <li>Positive Material Identification (PMI)</li>
            <li>Hardness Testing</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Inspection Coverage</h3>

        <p>
            Piping, Pipelines, Pressure Vessels, Heat Exchangers, Storage Tanks,
            Structural Steel, Blasting & Painting, Mechanical Installation,
            Hydro Testing, and Commissioning.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>
